    {
      "source": "Handles conversion from content <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> to <code>Properties</code> object.\nAlso handles <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> to <code>Properties</code> conversion, for populating\na <code>Properties</code> object via XML \"map\" entries.",
      "translation": "处理从内容<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>到<code>Properties</code>对象的转换。\n此外，还处理<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>到<code>Properties</code>的转换，以便通过 XML“map”条目填充<code>Properties</code>对象。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The required format is defined in the standard <code>Properties</code>\ndocumentation. Each property must be on a new line.",
      "translation": "所需格式在标准 `<code>Properties</code>` 文档中定义。每个属性必须位于新行上。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Convert <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> into <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Properties.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Properties</code></a>, considering it as\nproperties content.",
      "translation": "将 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>` 转换为 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Properties.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Properties</code></a>，将其视为属性内容。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>text</code> - the text to be so converted",
      "translation": "<code>text</code> - 要如此转换的文本",
      "count": 2
